# Background update check for the "Update from GitHub" dashboard (__APP__).
# Runs hourly, but the worker itself skips the check unless the interval set in
# the dashboard (config.json, default 24h) has elapsed. "Check now" in the UI
# bypasses that throttle. Minute 17 avoids the top-of-the-hour rush.
17 * * * * root __INSTALL_DIR__/bin/ufg-worker check >/dev/null 2>&1
